1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,600
[Episode 9]

3
00:02:31,030 --> 00:02:31,840
Didn't sleep a wink.

4
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,190
Last night Uncle He and I

5
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:38,840
checked cameras around
Shuguang Community.

6
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:40,240
We were up all night.

7
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,560
He's asleep. Let's talk outside.

8
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,190
Morning.

9
00:02:44,190 --> 00:02:45,000
Sure.

10
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,080
Hey.

11
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:49,630
Yo.

12
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:51,800
Mm.

13
00:02:52,030 --> 00:02:53,360
Oh, you're all here.

14
00:02:54,030 --> 00:02:55,630
Oh, g-good morning.

15
00:02:55,630 --> 00:02:56,470
Morning.

16
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,080
Oh no.

17
00:02:58,630 --> 00:03:00,470
Now that everyone's here, let's talk.

18
00:03:01,630 --> 00:03:03,870
We made major progress yesterday.

19
00:03:03,870 --> 00:03:05,240
Come, let's go over it.

20
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:11,030
Everyone, take a look.

21
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:12,240
Uncle He and I

22
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:14,960
checked footage near Shuguang Community.

23
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,080
Wu Jia was last seen

24
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:20,560
the day after Yu Hongfei vanished.

25
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:24,150
He never appeared on camera again.

26
00:03:24,870 --> 00:03:26,560
But he couldn't have vanished.

27
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,240
Could he still be in the building?

28
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:31,750
Maybe he hid in a car
or wore a disguise.

29
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,590
Shuguang Community is

30
00:03:34,590 --> 00:03:35,470
very old.

31
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,400
Some parts

32
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,430
are even abandoned.

33
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,400
The residents there

34
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,560
are mostly migrant workers

35
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,750
and elderly people living alone.

36
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,400
The footage also shows no

37
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,590
unusual vehicles or outsiders coming in.

38
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,000
If he's hiding on purpose,

39
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,280
what would his motive be?

40
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:57,030
He looked extremely nervous on camera,

41
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:59,030
as if he was hiding from someone.

42
00:03:59,470 --> 00:04:03,840
This missing-person case isn't under
our major crimes unit.

43
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:04,960
Sorry for overstepping.

44
00:04:07,030 --> 00:04:10,030
You all know the Cuiping Mountain Road
case from seven years ago, right?

45
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:12,240
The one Uncle He was disciplined over.

46
00:04:17,270 --> 00:04:20,800
The suspect in that case

47
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:24,480
was Night Flight's owner, Chen Wenji.

48
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,190
At the time of the incident,

49
00:04:25,190 --> 00:04:27,560
he plunged into the river
with a young woman.

50
00:04:27,950 --> 00:04:29,800
Neither has been found since.

51
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:38,070
That missing woman was
my sister, Han Shuang.

52
00:04:39,870 --> 00:04:41,680
Now Zou Jun

53
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:43,270
and Xu Haodong have been murdered,

54
00:04:43,270 --> 00:04:45,190
while Wu Jia and Yu Hongfei vanished.

55
00:04:45,750 --> 00:04:48,070
I don't think these are
isolated incidents.

56
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,190
They're tied to the
case seven years ago.

57
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,390
That was seven years ago.

58
00:04:53,870 --> 00:04:55,240
Where do we even start?

59
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,750
Start with Wu Jia.

60
00:04:59,190 --> 00:05:00,830
He disappeared at this exact time.

61
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:03,000
He must be hiding a terrible secret.

62
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,270
Me?

63
00:05:18,270 --> 00:05:20,270
I was patrolling at the time.

64
00:05:20,390 --> 00:05:21,750
I heard some movement.

65
00:05:21,950 --> 00:05:23,480
I walked over,

66
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:25,070
sweeping the area with my flashlight.

67
00:05:25,430 --> 00:05:26,680
Usually,

68
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:27,950
no one lives above or below.

69
00:05:27,950 --> 00:05:29,630
There's never any noise.

70
00:05:29,950 --> 00:05:33,000
First, I saw a pool of blood.

71
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,390
Oh no.

72
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:37,240
I could still hear something.

73
00:05:37,270 --> 00:05:38,270
Then I shone my light inside.

74
00:05:39,190 --> 00:05:39,870
It scared me half to death.

75
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:41,630
A ball suddenly bounced out.

76
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:42,830
I turned and ran.

77
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,240
What did the noise sound like?

78
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,000
A dragging, scraping sound.

79
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,680
Like a baby

80
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,600
who couldn't walk yet

81
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,870
crawling across the floor.

82
00:05:50,310 --> 00:05:50,600
Come here.

83
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,000
Then officers from the station arrived.

84
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:53,870
What did they say?

85
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,680
No one believed me.

86
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,270
They said it was cat or dog blood.

87
00:05:57,270 --> 00:05:59,390
But no cat or dog could bleed that much.

88
00:05:59,390 --> 00:06:01,160
It was even dripping downstairs.

89
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,270
Where did you find it?

90
00:06:03,270 --> 00:06:04,830
See? Right here.

91
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:11,560
You left and then came back,

92
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,630
and the blood had run downstairs?

93
00:06:12,630 --> 00:06:14,270
Yes. Blood flows, doesn't it?

94
00:06:14,270 --> 00:06:16,430
So it all ran down there?

95
00:08:26,510 --> 00:08:27,750
Oh my God.

96
00:08:33,750 --> 00:08:36,200
Blood is four to five times
as viscous as water.

97
00:08:36,550 --> 00:08:38,150
And cement is porous,

98
00:08:38,150 --> 00:08:39,150
so it absorbs liquid quickly.

99
00:08:39,150 --> 00:08:42,750
Its surface can dry in
two to three minutes.

100
00:08:43,550 --> 00:08:44,000
So that means...

101
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:46,670
Between Lao Li leaving and returning,

102
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,960
the blood could not have flowed far.

103
00:08:49,270 --> 00:08:51,360
Someone committed the assault
in the hallway,

104
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:53,080
then wrapped the body in a raincoat

105
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:54,360
and dragged it upstairs.

106
00:08:55,790 --> 00:08:58,360
Then why use animal blood?

107
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:01,120
Someone used animal blood

108
00:09:01,670 --> 00:09:03,360
to cover up what happened here.

109
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,360
We need

110
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,790
to inspect further.

111
00:09:32,390 --> 00:09:33,360
I should go.

112
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,600
Too many eyes are watching lately.

113
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,240
I can't keep coming here.

114
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,120
Once you sell this dump,

115
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,240
move in with me.

116
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:45,910
Zhou Yong.

117
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:52,120
Do you think my child

118
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:55,120
really came back?

119
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:58,960
When I'm home alone,

120
00:10:00,510 --> 00:10:02,750
he smiles at me from the room.

121
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:08,320
He loves every toy I bought him.

122
00:10:09,910 --> 00:10:11,550
He even calls me Mom.

123
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,200
Don't let your imagination run wild.

124
00:10:15,550 --> 00:10:17,390
No one's gonna hurt you anymore.

125
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:20,360
We'll start a new life together.

126
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:27,200
I want us to have a baby.

127
00:10:29,030 --> 00:10:31,030
He'll want to be my child again.

128
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,000
No, Ms. Yun.

129
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,030
Ms. Yun.

130
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:34,440
Ms. Yun.

131
00:10:35,870 --> 00:10:36,270
Ms. Yun.

132
00:10:36,630 --> 00:10:37,120
Ms. Yun.

133
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,600
No! Stop!

134
00:11:22,630 --> 00:11:24,000
Be careful.

135
00:11:24,390 --> 00:11:25,630
You burned yourself again, didn't you?

136
00:11:26,510 --> 00:11:28,390
Didn't I already tell you?

137
00:11:28,750 --> 00:11:31,240
The egg may feel cool on the outside,

138
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,720
but the yolk is still hot.

139
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,600
So split it open with chopsticks.

140
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:41,390
But I like the runny yolk.

141
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:44,600
It'll spill into the noodles
if I split it open.

142
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:51,030
Next time, I'll put it
in a separate bowl for you.

143
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:53,550
Then you can eat it
however you want, okay?

144
00:11:53,750 --> 00:11:55,510
The yolk won't run into your noodles.

145
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,150
Okay.

146
00:12:58,010 --> 00:13:00,070
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

147
00:13:00,070 --> 00:13:02,010
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

148
00:13:02,020 --> 00:13:03,920
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

149
00:13:03,930 --> 00:13:05,730
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

150
00:13:05,730 --> 00:13:08,070
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

151
00:13:08,070 --> 00:13:10,490
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

152
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:15,540
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

153
00:13:15,550 --> 00:13:17,440
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

154
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,390
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

155
00:13:19,390 --> 00:13:21,510
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

156
00:13:21,550 --> 00:13:23,520
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

157
00:13:23,520 --> 00:13:25,680
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

158
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:32,760
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

159
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:36,130
♪Why is that child crying?♪

160
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:38,830
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

161
00:13:38,830 --> 00:13:40,440
♪Means I've grown up♪

162
00:13:40,450 --> 00:13:43,590
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

163
00:13:43,590 --> 00:13:47,080
♪The wound still aches♪

164
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:51,840
♪Like a biting winter♪

165
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:55,100
♪But a spark still glows♪

